<title>NORWAY: SOCCER-EUROPEAN WOMEN'S CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-EUROPEAN WOMEN'S CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Women's European championship group B</p>
<p>results on Thursday:</p>
<p>Italy     2     Denmark     2    (halftime 0-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Italy - Carolina Morace 58, Patrizia Panico 80</p>
<p>Denmark - Lene Bjerning Terp 22, Merete Pedersen 61</p>
<p>Norway    0	Germany    0</p>
